{"user": "Now g2 flips 5 (f2 + the whole g3-g6 column) and b6 flips 4. Does g2 hand White anything nasty like h1? Which do I play?", "user_ts": "2026-08-04T01:38:08.893398+00:00", "assistant": "Play **c8**.\n\nYes: **g2 does give White h1** \u2014 after Black plays g2, the diagonal **h1\u2013g2\u2013f3** makes **h1** a legal White corner move. That corner is permanent, so the 5-disc flip is a trap.\n\nBetween your options, **c8** is the endgame move that holds the win with best play.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-04T01:38:08.893398+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-04T01:38:13.893398+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question", "Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question", "Solution Request"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 1, "Solution Request": 3, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 2}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 0.3333333333333333, "Solution Request": 1.0, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question", "Solution Request"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question", "Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question", "Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "Worked Line": 2, "General Principle": 2, "Positive Feedback": 1}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "Worked Line": 0.6666666666666666, "General Principle": 0.6666666666666666, "Positive Feedback": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "Worked Line", "General Principle"], "sonn